The first time I played a Tourist, it bothered me that I couldn't pay
for things in a shop using my credit card.  So the game should be extended
in the following way:

When making payment in a shop (or donating to a priest) you should be able 
to select payment by card upto the amount of gold the card is charged upto.

When selling things in a shop you should be able to get put the gold
you get into your card.

Reading the card should tell you how much gold you have in it.

There should be a bank on the Mall level of the mines where you
can put gold into and out of your card.  Or if you don't have a card
You should be able to but one there.

If you use the card to pick locks there should be a small probability
that you damage the card and it looses your money.

Lepercauns should also have a small chance of stealing your card
instead of your loose gold.

Wehn I get a chance (in about 3 weeks) I will program this all up to
see how it works.

